Well, all my experience is with Nethack v3.0j, so don't be too
surprised if some of this advice doesn't hold water.

Lumps of royal jelly are really nice to have around.  They have a
rather high nutritive value for their weight, they will heal your legs
if they become wounded, and they will permanently raise your Strength
by one point.  (Note that means one percentage point, so if your
Strength is in the low 18/xx range, save them up and boost it with
giant corpses.)

>Also, waaaaayyy back on level 1 I was stupid enough to eat a Leprechan (sp?)
>adn I've been jumping aroun ever since.  HOW DO I STOP THIS @#$&*%* ANNOYING
>JUMPING??!?!!?

You can't stop it.  The important question is how to control it.  You
can gain control of your teleporting by either wearing a ring of
teleport control or by eating a tengu corpse (though this doesn't
always work, it's preferable since it allows you to use your ring
fingers for other things).

